# Tunnel executables, fetched by the downloadTunnelBinaries Gradle task from the release
# produced by .github/workflows/tunnel-binaries.yml. NOT committed: they were ~40 MB of
# unverifiable prebuilt blobs (UPX-packed, three with the PackHeader stripped so they
# could not even be unpacked for inspection). They are digest-pinned in app/build.gradle.kts.
